   how much swap space to configure.

DEC OSF/1 AXP can use either method, If the file /sbin/swapdefault is
softlinked to a swap partition, then the 'eager' (traditional) method is
used; if the file doesn't exist, then the 'lazy' (don't allocate swap
until you need it) method is used.

