> Hesiod routines to DEC's OSF/1?

Porting hesiod 1.2 itself was easy: just change two instances of
u_long/long to u_int/int and hesinfo works as expected.

I had to make many similar changes to bind 4.9 alpha to get a working
version of it's libresolv.a.  You can probably use DEC's libresolv from
4.8.x until 4.9 is generally available, although I haven't tried that.

	Rainer

